{
  "title": "Quaintly Spiced Canadian Lamb Stew",
  "description": "A hearty and flavorful stew featuring lamb, red pepper paste, and shio-koji cure, perfect for a cold winter's night. This dish is free from animal by-products and is Buddhist-temple friendly.",
  "cuisine": "Canadian",
  "diet": [
